6
00:01:35,119 --> 00:01:37,439
och vindkraft.

7
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:40,439
Häng med.

8
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,320
som traditionella medier dock valde att

9
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:44,399
